ense fallback={<div>Suspense!</div>}>\n  (4 more lines)\n\n(Output was cut short: narrow the path or pattern, name a repo, or raise the limit.)","sources":[{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core","path":"packages/framework/esm-react-utils/src/openmrsComponentDecorator.tsx","name":"openmrsComponentDecorator.tsx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core","path":"packages/framework/esm-react-utils/src/useConfig.test.tsx","name":"useConfig.test.tsx","revision":"HEAD"}]}}

